ibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2019JC015483\",\n          \"source_locator\": \"Sections 2.1-2.2: drifter support, 1993-2018 selection, fitted seasonal fields and December-March winter. Section 3 seasonal discussion after Figures 5-6: eastward SECC reaches about 90 E before recirculating into SEC; Figure 13 caption.\",\n          \"observed_period\": null,\n          \"related_current_ids\": [\n            \"indian-south-equatorial-undercurrent\"\n          ],\n          \"supporting_sources\": [\n            {\n              \"label\": \"Section frequency and phase classification: Huang et al. (2023)\",\n              \"url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2022JC019147\",\n              \"locator\": \"Sections 2.1 and 3.1, Figure 2 caption\",\n              \"access\": \"Relevant full-text sections inspected; no current edge or width geometry extracted.\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"evidence_links\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Compare twelve surrounding Indian Ocean source-vector maps\",\n          \"url\": \"../figures/indian-secc-oscar-2d-source.svg\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Query surrounding Indian Ocean monthly fields and paired support\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Findian-secc-oscar-2d-monthly-source-fields.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonths%22%2C%22limit%22%3A1%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Query monthly source coverage and component ranges\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Findian-secc-oscar-2d-monthly-source-fields.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonthly_summary%22%2C%22limit%22%3A12%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Download retained source vectors and metadata (ZIP)\",\n          \"url\": \"../research/source-data/oscar-indian-secc-2d-2013/source-respon