orial_reference_route\",\n          \"note\": \"Declared western Hopen Deep Northern-branch study-area reach, from an OSW southern Hopen approach gate near 30 E, 75 N to the LS05 frontal/core neighborhood near 28.5 E, 77 N. Excludes Barents Sea entrance, Central branch, eastern continuations and cyclonic recirculation loops. Not the full North Cape Current or an observed trajectory.\",\n          \"candidate_id\": \"north-cape-northern-reach-reference-path-candidate\",\n          \"state_semantic_exclusions\": [],\n          \"spatial_geometry\": {\n            \"type\": \"LineString\",\n            \"coordinates\": [\n              [\n                30.0,\n                75.0\n              ],\n              [\n                29.90273108251,\n                75.08344109436757\n              ],\n              [\n                29.804393551043148,\n                75.16684003433863\n              ],\n              [\n                29.704969825116592,\n                75.2501961192544\n              ],\n              [\n                29.604441949737748,\n                75.3335086328218\n              ],\n              [\n                29.50279158576768,\n                75.41677684268782\n              ],\n              [\n                29.400000000000006,\n                75.5\n              ],\n              [\n                29.335219746204302,\n                75.58338053707315\n              ],\n              [\n                29.269702257703784,\n                75.6667426134727\n              ],\n              [\n                29.203434758789,\n                75.75008591911856\n              ],\n              [\n                29.13640418093243,\n                75.83341013663366\n              ],\n              [\n                29.068597154469643,\n                75.9167149411321\n              ],\n              [\n                29.0,\n                76.0\n              ],\n              [\n                28.951467727267016,\n        