ope-audit.json\",\n          \"summary\": \"The 2010 model proposes SICU east of the Solomon Islands. A pinned 2017 primary paper interprets northward flow near northeast Bougainville, with ADCP and tracer station context. OSW adds an offshore geographic reference reach; continuous measured axis, complete endpoints, width and annual ranges remain unresolved.\",\n          \"source_url\": \"https://faculty.washington.edu/kessler/abstracts/melet_etal_2010.html\",\n          \"source_locator\": \"Author-hosted abstract: previously unknown current east of Solomon Sea formed where SEC meets Solomon Islands; named Solomon Islands Coastal Undercurrent.\",\n          \"observed_period\": null,\n          \"supporting_sources\": [\n            {\n              \"label\": \"Ganachaud et al. (2017), Solomon Sea cruises\",\n              \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1525/elementa.221\",\n              \"locator\": \"Figures 2 and 7; pages 5-7, 11-12 and 17\",\n              \"access\": \"Original NOAA-hosted PDF acquired and institutional SHA256 matched; CC BY 4.0 printed page 27; selected pages and figures inspected.\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"evidence_links\": [],\n      \"object_url\": \"object.html?id=current%3Asolomon-island-coastal-undercurrent\",\n      \"route_url\": \"reference-routes.html#solomon-island-coastal-undercurrent-reference-path-candidate\",\n      \"season_url\": \"seasons.html?current=solomon-island-coastal-undercurrent\",\n      \"dashboard_search\": \"Solomon Island Coastal Undercurrent Southwestern tropical Pacific / Solomon Islands\",\n      \"width_ids\": [\n        \"sicu-melet-2010-coastal-confinement\"\n      ],\n      \"measurement_ids\": [],\n      \"route_ids\": [\n        \"solomon-island-coastal-undercurrent-reference-path-candidate\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"source:14f30cbbf1cd40e4\",\n        \"source:4dc5fc618c26565f\",\n        \"source:4f7441b953be4651\",\n        \"source:803229fe82e