08\",\n              \"source_citation\": \"Miller, H. A. (2006), Modeling studies of the coastal/littoral current system off Southern Australia, PhD dissertation, Naval Postgraduate School, December 2006.\",\n              \"source_locator\": \"Printed p.48 experiment setup, p.49 width description, Figure4.20e on p.233; PDF pages79,80,264 (1-based).\",\n              \"source_access\": \"Complete 431-page original acquired from NPS Library archive deposit; selected setup, quantity and section figure reviewed. Not all dissertation pages reviewed.\",\n              \"source_publication_year\": 2006,\n              \"name\": \"South Australian Current\",\n              \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\n              \"phase_kind\": \"model_snapshot_width_summary\",\n              \"phase_label\": \"Experiment 6 · model day 20\",\n              \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_local_model_current_scale\",\n              \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate local model scale; no numerical uncertainty or temporal range reported.\",\n              \"section_orientation\": \"Meridional section at 130°E; displayed zonal velocity is normal to the section.\",\n              \"time_convention\": \"Elapsed model day 20 in Experiment 6 with annual climatological forcing; not an observed calendar date or an annual mean width.\",\n              \"time_support_kind\": \"elapsed_model_day\",\n              \"is_climatology\": false,\n              \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_process_model_snapshot\",\n              \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed original prose and checked its experiment setup and Figure4.20e; no edge digitization.\",\n              \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-21\",\n              \"source_document_sha256\": \"c2a90767085d99e788ae93f6fd7422f00fd687e4c0ccb78341da0c78f600743b\",\n              \"boundary_sides\": \"author_reported_model_scale_without_extracted_edges\",\n              \"full_width_inference_el