1-2018.\",\r\n          \"locator\": \"Section 2.1: buoyant Po-forced WAC along Italian coast and wind modulation; section 2.2: separate Gulf of Manfredonia setting.\",\r\n          \"role\": \"Surface branch identity and regional origin; local HF radar/larval paths do not define the full current axis.\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"candidate_file\": \"research/western-adriatic-reference-path-candidate.json\",\r\n      \"candidate_sha256\": \"a27cdcff26ddf8d927e08322e9f7e282e8a21b745e8f6adf9ce725d026ea4150\",\r\n      \"generator_sha256\": \"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240\",\r\n      \"figure\": \"figures/western-adriatic-reference-path-candidate.svg\",\r\n      \"nominal_atlas_state_crossings\": [\r\n        \"MEDI\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"recommended_nasa_tile_id\": \"level2_C_2\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Scientific review of named-flow gates and regional scope.\",\r\n        \"Verify shelf/slope correspondence with reproducible bathymetry or suitable velocity data.\",\r\n        \"Canonical admission and publication review; these are editorial route lengths.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"parent_current_id\": null,\r\n      \"parent_scope_note\": null,\r\n      \"ordering_sensitivity\": {\r\n        \"overlapping_candidate_ids\": [\r\n          \"alaska-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"irminger-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"mindanao-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"oyashio-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"algerian-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"east-adriatic-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"south-australian-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"west-spitsbergen-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"zeehan-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"northern-mediterranean-reference-path-candidate\",\r\n          \"somali-summer-southern-reference-path-candidate\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"envelope_position_bounds\": [\r\n          25,\