cks_passed_not_scientific_approval\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","source_sha256":"b06caed27655c39f8127ddda441cba0a856800f599ec52edcd5b30d2ad37b633"},"widths":{"source_file":"research/ocean-current-width-inventory.json","source_json":"{\r\n  \"schema\": \"osw.current-width-inventory.v1\",\r\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-10-21\",\r\n  \"status\": \"editorial_width_inventory_not_canonical\",\r\n  \"protocol_file\": \"plans/ocean-current-width-measurement-protocol-v1.md\",\r\n  \"current_ledger_sha256\": \"6c8a143208c0953512875f222154a819d5f56b7326daa6816f0609e61b4f261e\",\r\n  \"scope\": \"All 100 canonical names tracked; initial width evidence collection is incomplete. Proposed new current identities remain outside this inventory.\",\r\n  \"counts\": {\r\n    \"currents\": 100,\r\n    \"currents_with_scoped_width_evidence\": 82,\r\n    \"measurements\": 156,\r\n    \"currents_with_existing_mentions_pending_review\": 0,\r\n    \"currents_not_assessed\": 13,\r\n    \"currents_with_derived_width_candidates_pending_review\": 1,\r\n    \"currents_with_sources_reviewed_no_numeric_width\": 1,\r\n    \"currents_with_section_span_diagnostics_width_unresolved\": 3\r\n  },\r\n  \"measurements\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"persian-gulf-gogp99-r13-geostrophic-band\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"persian-gulf-saline-overflow\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Persian Gulf saline overflow\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_geostrophic_band_scale\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 30,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate spatial scale. The 30 km band and 5 km peak are different definitions at R13, not two occupations, a physical variability range, or numerical error.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"GOGP99 section R13 near the Strait of Hormuz. No section endpoints or current-axis coordinates extracted.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Source geostrophic velocity normal to R13; no geographic paired edge reconstruction.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Subsurface outflow description; 30 m velocity reference and 45 m transport partition do not define the width measurement layer.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"October-November1999 GOGP99 section context. Width prose names R13 without realization suffix; R13b method/figure linkage does not supply an independently verified exact width date.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-described flow band near 0.1 m/s; the speed is a description, not an extracted boundary threshold.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://archimer.ifremer.fr/doc/00000/390/83.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Pous, S.P., Carton, X. and Lazure, P. (2004), Hydrology and circulation in the Strait of Hormuz and the Gulf of Oman: Results from the GOGP99 Experiment, parts 1 and 2, JGR Oceans 109, doi:10.1029/2003JC002145 and doi:10.1029/2003JC002146. Institutional author versions.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Part2 author version printed p6/PDF7, R13 velocity-width description; part1 printed p5/PDF6 and Fig9 printed p22/PDF23, reference method; Table1 printed p13/PDF14, occupation context.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-14\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"author_reported_companion_study_geostrophic_spatial_scale\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed explicit width descriptions from original part2; checked companion part1 method, Fig9 and occupation table. No curve digitization.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"R13 geostrophic flow band description\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"whole_current_width_km\": null,\r\n      \"annual_width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Source warns about geostrophic accuracy and reference choice. No contemporaneous R13/R12 ADCP; missing D2 data. Width edge cutoff and numerical width error unspecified.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Recover original paired velocity edges and exact width-occupation linkage.\",\r\n        \"Review reference sensitivity and flow identification before physical width inference.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"description_kind\": \"gogp99_geostrophic_spatial_scale\",\r\n        \"spatial_operator\": \"band\",\r\n        \"typical_or_peak_velocity_m_s\": 0.1,\r\n        \"velocity_boundary_threshold_m_s\": null,\r\n        \"velocity_description_is_boundary_cutoff\": false,\r\n        \"velocity_reference_depth_m\": 30,\r\n        \"added_reference_velocity_m_s\": 0.09,\r\n        \"reference_velocity_is_contemporaneous_adcp\": false,\r\n        \"r13_r12_adcp_available\": false,\r\n        \"d2_returned_data\": false,\r\n        \"transport_partition_depth_m\": 45,\r\n        \"reference_or_transport_depth_is_width_layer\": false,\r\n        \"method_figure_section\": \"R13b\",\r\n        \"width_description_section\": \"R13\",\r\n        \"width_occupation_date_verified\": false,\r\n        \"r13_occupation_dates_context\": [\r\n          \"1999-10-11\",\r\n          \"1999-10-22\",\r\n          \"1999-11-02\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"earlier_reference_year_is_width_year\": false,\r\n        \"salinity_width_is_velocity_width\": false,\r\n        \"band_and_peak_are_independent_occupations\": false,\r\n        \"band_peak_difference_is_error_or_seasonal_range\": false,\r\n        \"boundary_coordinates_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Persian Gulf outflow: approximately 30 km geostrophic flow band. Reference-dependent geostrophic description, not an ADCP width or specified edge threshold. The 30 km band and 5 km peak are distinct operators, not annual extrema or uncertainty.\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"About 30 km: geostrophic flow band near 0.1 m/s. A spatial description at R13; the stated speed is not an extracted width cutoff.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"GOGP99 1999 context; 30 m reference plus 0.09 m/s mean offset. No R13/R12 ADCP returned. Exact width occupation, fixed layer, geographic edges and width error unknown. The band/peak and salinity-core widths are separate definitions.\",\r\n        \"comparison_figure\": \"figures/persian-gulf-gogp99-geostrophic-scales.svg\",\r\n        \"comparison_figure_label\": \"Compare the flow band and faster peak\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/persian-gulf-gogp99-geostrophic-scales-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"6f4a7c211cb02fc5906c5d6e98279022bec688f446a1ba20aa7aa79a6c2d28d1\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/0\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"persian-gulf-gogp99-r13-geostrophic-peak\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"persian-gulf-saline-overflow\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Persian Gulf saline overflow\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_geostrophic_peak_scale\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 5,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate spatial scale. The 30 km band and 5 km peak are different definitions at R13, not two occupations, a physical variability range, or numerical error.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"GOGP99 section R13 near the Strait of Hormuz. No section endpoints or current-axis coordinates extracted.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Source geostrophic velocity normal to R13; no geographic paired edge reconstruction.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Subsurface outflow description; 30 m velocity reference and 45 m transport partition do not define the width measurement layer.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"October-November1999 GOGP99 section context. Width prose names R13 without realization suffix; R13b method/figure linkage does not supply an independently verified exact width date.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-described narrow faster peak near 0.4 m/s; the speed is a description, not an extracted boundary threshold.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://archimer.ifremer.fr/doc/00000/390/83.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Pous, S.P., Carton, X. and Lazure, P. (2004), Hydrology and circulation in the Strait of Hormuz and the Gulf of Oman: Results from the GOGP99 Experiment, parts 1 and 2, JGR Oceans 109, doi:10.1029/2003JC002145 and doi:10.1029/2003JC002146. Institutional author versions.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Part2 author version printed p6/PDF7, R13 velocity-width description; part1 printed p5/PDF6 and Fig9 printed p22/PDF23, reference method; Table1 printed p13/PDF14, occupation context.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-14\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"author_reported_companion_study_geostrophic_spatial_scale\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed explicit width descriptions from original part2; checked companion part1 method, Fig9 and occupation table. No curve digitization.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"R13 faster geostrophic peak description\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"whole_current_width_km\": null,\r\n      \"annual_width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Source warns about geostrophic accuracy and reference choice. No contemporaneous R13/R12 ADCP; missing D2 data. Width edge cutoff and numerical width error unspecified.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Recover original paired velocity edges and exact width-occupation linkage.\",\r\n        \"Review reference sensitivity and flow identification before physical width inference.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"description_kind\": \"gogp99_geostrophic_spatial_scale\",\r\n        \"spatial_operator\": \"peak\",\r\n        \"typical_or_peak_velocity_m_s\": 0.4,\r\n        \"velocity_boundary_threshold_m_s\": null,\r\n        \"velocity_description_is_boundary_cutoff\": false,\r\n        \"velocity_reference_depth_m\": 30,\r\n        \"added_reference_velocity_m_s\": 0.09,\r\n        \"reference_velocity_is_contemporaneous_adcp\": false,\r\n        \"r13_r12_adcp_available\": false,\r\n        \"d2_returned_data\": false,\r\n        \"transport_partition_depth_m\": 45,\r\n        \"reference_or_transport_depth_is_width_layer\": false,\r\n        \"method_figure_section\": \"R13b\",\r\n        \"width_description_section\": \"R13\",\r\n        \"width_occupation_date_verified\": false,\r\n        \"r13_occupation_dates_context\": [\r\n          \"1999-10-11\",\r\n          \"1999-10-22\",\r\n          \"1999-11-02\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"earlier_reference_year_is_width_year\": false,\r\n        \"salinity_width_is_velocity_width\": false,\r\n        \"band_and_peak_are_independent_occupations\": false,\r\n        \"band_peak_difference_is_error_or_seasonal_range\": false,\r\n        \"boundary_coordinates_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Persian Gulf outflow: approximately 5 km faster geostrophic peak. Reference-dependent geostrophic description, not an ADCP width or specified edge threshold. The 30 km band and 5 km peak are distinct operators, not annual extrema or uncertainty.\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"About 5 km: faster geostrophic peak near 0.4 m/s. A spatial description at R13; the stated speed is not an extracted width cutoff.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"GOGP99 1999 context; 30 m reference plus 0.09 m/s mean offset. No R13/R12 ADCP returned. Exact width occupation, fixed layer, geographic edges and width error unknown. The band/peak and salinity-core widths are separate definitions.\",\r\n        \"comparison_figure\": \"figures/persian-gulf-gogp99-geostrophic-scales.svg\",\r\n        \"comparison_figure_label\": \"Compare the flow band and faster peak\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/persian-gulf-gogp99-geostrophic-scales-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"6f4a7c211cb02fc5906c5d6e98279022bec688f446a1ba20aa7aa79a6c2d28d1\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/1\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"atlantic-seuc-molinari-1981-core-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"atlantic-south-equatorial-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Atlantic South Equatorial Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_velocity_contour_core_span\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 120,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate author-reported 20 cm/s core width. Abstract approximately 100 km is separate unreconciled context, not an endpoint, error or independent occupation.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Eastern and western Atlantic sections: approximately 25–29 W and 4 W, within the 1978–1980 study. Not the newer 35 W ledger section or the entire current.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Source cross-current sections; no geographic edge pair or exact flow-normal projection extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Subthermocline 20 cm/s isotach core. Reported core depths and vertical extent are context, not fixed width-layer limits.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Author summary across six 1978–1980 cruises. Individual figure dates do not date this characteristic width; no per-cruise or seasonal width series extracted.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Source defines the core as flow within the 20 cm/s isotach and reports about 120 km core width. This is not the net-flow boundary.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://archimer.ifremer.fr/doc/00121/23229/21063.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Molinari, R. L., Voituriez, B., and Duncan, P. (1981), Observations in the subthermocline undercurrent of the Equatorial South Atlantic Ocean: 1978–1980, Oceanologica Acta 4(4), 451–456.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Printed p453/PDF p3, core definition and width paragraphs; abstract p451/PDF p1; methods/captions p452/PDF p2; net-flow boundary limitation p456/PDF p6.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-14\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_original_campaign_core_summary\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Transcribed the explicit contour-defined body core width after original-page review; no figure digitization or geographic edge inference.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"1978–1980 study · 20 cm/s core summary\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": 