cal-width statement.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Introductory regional literature summary in a 2017 winter study. The October 2012-March 2013 experiment dates do not date this typical width; seasonal variation is qualitative only.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported typical regional width; no paired boundaries, velocity threshold or width occupation interval assigned to the 35 km introduction statement.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1002/2016JC012102\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Jarosz, Wang, Wijesekera, Pegau and Moum (2017), Flow variability within the Alaska Coastal Current in winter, JGR Oceans 122, 3884-3906, doi:10.1002/2016JC012102.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 1 Introduction, second paragraph: typical approximately 35 km width; distinct shelf circulation from subarctic gyre in preceding paragraph.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-08\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_regional_prose_synthesis\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate 35 km scalar transcribed from publisher Introduction; no axis, footprint or paired edges reconstructed.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Typical Gulf-of-Alaska coastal width (regional summary)\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_scalar_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"regional_scalar_context\": {\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/alaska-coastal-gulf-jarosz-2017-regional-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"308e05e7c1c8122aaee0b917b85822b1162b8b25021aa0f77387eca11714843b\",\r\n        \"boundary_coordinate