l width reported from a mean surface-flow profile. Two locations are not a seasonal/annual interval, numerical uncertainty or confidence interval.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Cross-shore mean profile off Pesaro, northwestern Adriatic; section BB-prime in Figures 13-14.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Source cross-shore transect; exact geographic endpoint coordinates not extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Radar surface flow; approximately 1 m effective measurement depth is not a fixed-depth slab.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Deployment October 2002 to October 2004; source calls profiles two-year means. Site-specific coverage and gaps differ, with exact averaging weights and valid width timestamps unresolved.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported width of mean alongshore-flow profile. Figure 15 uses coast to distance of no mean flow; no exact zero crossings or geographic edges digitized.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://fulir.irb.hr/2078/1/Chavanne_etal_JGR2007.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Chavanne, Janekovic, Flament, Poulain, Kuzmic and Gurgel (2007), Tidal currents in the northwestern Adriatic: High-frequency radio observations and numerical model predictions, JGR 112 C03S21, doi:10.1029/2006JC003523.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 5 paragraph 30, PDF6-7; Figures 13-14, PDF14; experimental setting paragraphs 8-13 and Figure 2, PDF2-3; Figure 15, PDF15.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-09\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_original_local_mean_profile_width\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Reported local mean widths transcribed from visually inspected original prose, with source profiles inspected but not digitized.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligibl