b2eca70e\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"Hirtshals: 20-25 km reported satellite-image width estimate, cited by Nielsen from Aarup (1994a). Image dates and boundary methods unknown. Sites and sources do not establish a 10-40 km seasonal range; no mapped edges.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Satellite-image estimate cited in thesis prose; original Aarup images, dates, sensor and edge threshold unreviewed. Mostly mixed-water/bathymetry descriptions do not define image depth. Midsummer widening is qualitative water-mass evidence, not dated numeric satellite widths.\",\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Hirtshals: 20-25 km reported satellite-image width estimate, cited by Nielsen from Aarup (1994a). Image dates and boundary methods unknown. Sites and sources do not establish a 10-40 km seasonal range; no mapped edges.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/jutland-nielsen-2000-cited-satellite-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"7e5b8d9899ca5eea3664c83ffc3f7f6457dc65934505285032ad04a64f9d7121\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/2\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"sicu-melet-2010-coastal-confinement\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"solomon-island-coastal-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Solomon Island Coastal Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_one_sided_coastal_confinement\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": null,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"author_reported_within_coast_distance\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One-sided coastal confinement description, not a representative current width, rigorous bound, zero-to-scale interval, numerical uncertainty or annual extrema.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Pacific side of Solomon Islands eastern coast; local box 3 context near 6°S.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Distance relative to coast in source prose; coast-normal operator and paired cross-flow edges unresolved.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Modeled subsurface thermocline flow; sigma 24.0–26.5 context varies in depth. Core near 200 m is not a fixed width layer.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Model mean context analyzed over 1986–2004; no dated width occupations or monthly widths.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Source prose confinement relative to coast; no velocity cutoff or paired boundary coordinates adopted.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://hal.science/hal-00534041v1/file/2009jpo4264_2E1.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Melet et al. (2010), Thermocline Circulation in the Solomon Sea: A Modeling Study, J. Phys. Oceanogr. 40(6), 1302–1319, doi:10.1175/2009JPO4264.1, HAL hal-00534041v1.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 5c, printed p1315 / HAL PDF p15; Figure 12 printed p1316 / PDF p16. Model/layer context printed pp1303–1308 / PDF pp3–8.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-09\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"model_coastal_confinement\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Confinement relation transcribed from visually inspected original paper; no profile or axis digitization.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"SICU model coastal confinement\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Original model paper proposes SICU; its 100 km confinement is a model description, not measured width. Later Pandora interpretation is separate.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Resolve coast-distance convention and paired layer-specific velocity edges.\",\r\n        \"Recover original velocity fields or cruise methods and exact section/date support.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission; no physical state-intersection or seasonal-width inference.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"width_passage_visually_inspected\": true,\r\n        \"description_kind\": \"coastal-confinement\",\r\n        \"underlying_width_source\": \"Original Melet 2010 model prose, section 5c.\",\r\n        \"underlying_width_methods_reviewed\": false,\r\n        \"original_reporting_paper_reviewed\": true,\r\n        \"underlying_cited_observation_paper_reviewed\": false,\r\n        \"paired_width_boundaries_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"coast_distance_is_full_width\": false,\r\n        \"confinement_is_rigorous_bound\": false,\r\n        \"core_depth_is_fixed_width_layer\": false,\r\n        \"core_speed_is_width_threshold\": false,\r\n        \"model_grid_spacing_is_width_uncertainty\": false,\r\n        \"transport_variability_is_width_variability\": false,\r\n        \"transport_calendar_is_width_calendar\": false,\r\n        \"model_years_are_observation_dates\": false,\r\n        \"integration_gate_is_width_edge\": false,\r\n        \"density_layer_is_fixed_depth_slab\": false,\r\n        \"map_buffer_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"neighboring_current_scale_inheritance_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"model_context\": {\r\n          \"product\": \"Nested NEMO/OPA Solomon Sea 1/12° model\",\r\n          \"z_levels\": 46,\r\n          \"simulation_years\": [\r\n            1984,\r\n            2004\r\n          ],\r\n          \"analysis_climatology_years\": [\r\n            1986,\r\n            2004\r\n          ],\r\n          \"daily_outputs\": true,\r\n          \"thermocline_sigma_bounds\": [\r\n            24.0,\r\n            26.5\r\n          ],\r\n          \"approximate_depth_context_m\": [\r\n            100,\r\n            400\r\n          ],\r\n          \"is_fixed_width_layer\": false,\r\n          \"is_observation_period\": false,\r\n          \"is_monthly_width_series\": false\r\n        },\r\n        \"core_context\": {\r\n          \"evidence\": \"model\",\r\n          \"approximate_depth_m\": 200,\r\n          \"approximate_speed_cm_s\": 20\r\n        },\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Solomon Island Coastal Undercurrent: 100 kilometre one-sided coastal confinement description. Model result. Representative width, paired boundaries and seasonal width range unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"Within 100 km of coast · modeled SICU confinement. Representative width and numerical uncertainty unknown; no zero-to-scale interval, paired edges or annual range.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Original HAL PDF inspected. 1986–2004 model climatology and sigma 24.0–26.5 thermocline context are not dated width observations or a fixed depth slab.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/solomon-melet-2010-coastal-confinement-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"9479bb446cb945602bc253969ca71217d073c93d8b135883005dfffb35236656\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/0\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"reported_width_constraint\": {\r\n        \"kind\": \"author_reported_one_sided_coastal_confinement\",\r\n        \"reference_scale_km\": 100,\r\n        \"source_notation\": \"within 100 km of coast\",\r\n        \"is_rigorous_upper_bound\": false,\r\n        \"representative_width_km\": null,\r\n        \"lower_bound_km\": null,\r\n        \"upper_bound_km\": null\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"nicu-melet-2010-coastal-confinement\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"new-ireland-coastal-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"New Ireland Coastal Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\