ntour coordinates and reproduce the meridional separation with product provenance.\",\r\n        \"Establish dated contour/velocity definitions before monthly or seasonal widths.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission; no whole-current ranking, route buffer or physical state intersection.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"width_passage_visually_inspected\": true,\r\n        \"description_kind\": \"climatological-mdt-major-front-separation\",\r\n        \"underlying_width_methods_reviewed\": true,\r\n        \"full_study_reproduced\": false,\r\n        \"temporal_operator\": \"climatological_mean\",\r\n        \"product\": \"CNES-CLS18 MDT\",\r\n        \"reference_period_years\": [\r\n          1993,\r\n          2012\r\n        ],\r\n        \"boundary_labels\": [\r\n          \"SAF\",\r\n          \"SACCF\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"boundary_mdt_m\": [\r\n          -0.1,\r\n          -1.0\r\n        ],\r\n        \"intermediate_front\": {\r\n          \"name\": \"PF\",\r\n          \"mdt_m\": -0.58\r\n        },\r\n        \"boundary_coordinates_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"meridional_distance_is_flow_normal_width\": false,\r\n        \"point_is_whole_current_width\": false,\r\n        \"other_quantity_is_range_endpoint\": false,\r\n        \"cruise_months_are_width_occupations\": false,\r\n        \"particle_months_are_width_calendar\": false,\r\n        \"grid_spacing_is_width_uncertainty\": false,\r\n        \"hydrographic_front_agreement_is_width_uncertainty\": false,\r\n        \"transport_error_is_width_uncertainty\": false,\r\n        \"jet_speed_association_is_edge_cutoff\": false,\r\n        \"argo_temperature_depths_are_width_layer\": false,\r\n        \"seasonal_calendar_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"map_buffer_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"cross_current_width_inheritance_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"separate_context\": {\r\n          \"other_quantity_km\": 500,\r\n          \"drake_major_front_separation_approx_km\": 270,\r\n          \"drake_longitude_degrees_east\": -58,\r\n          \"cruise_months\": [\r\n            \"2016-02\",\r\n            \"2017-12\"\r\n          ],\r\n          \"particle_tracking_months\": [\r\n            \"2015-11\",\r\n            \"2016-04\"\r\n          ],\r\n          \"argo_validation_years\": [\r\n            2001,\r\n            2017\r\n          ],\r\n          \"assimilated_observation_years\": [\r\n            1993,\r\n            2016\r\n          ]\r\n        },\r\n        \"display_title\": \"Major-front separation\",\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Antarctic Circumpolar Current: approximately 170 kilometres, major-front separation between SAF and SACCF. Local meridional MDT contour separation at Udintsev, 144 degrees west, climatological reference period 1993 to 2012. Not a whole-current width or seasonal range. Numerical uncertainty and exact paired geographic edges unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"Approximately 170 km · Major-front separation (SAF–SACCF) at Udintsev, 144°W. Separate from the 500 km quantity; no pooled 170–500 km interval. Numerical uncertainty unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"CNES-CLS18 MDT reference period 1993–2012; boundary contours [-0.1, -1.0] m. Figure 5 uses meridional separation; exact paired geographic coordinates not extracted. Cruise months, Argo validation, grid spacing and transport do not define width dates, depth or uncertainty. No seasonal width playback.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/acc-park-2019-udintsev-breadths-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"311b5a41781c9987c81dc0b6c720f7a2cc3ebe2451cfcd696a19300b3fecc8a2\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/0\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"acc-park-2019-udintsev-boundary-breadth\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"acc\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Antarctic Circumpolar Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_climatological_boundary_breadth\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 500,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"no_interval_author_approximate_local_climatological_quantity\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"Approximate local climatological boundary-defined breadth; no uncertainty interval, seasonal range or pooled 170-500 km interval.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Udintsev Fracture Zone entrance at 144 degrees W; local meridional contour separation.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Meridional distance between source-defined MDT contours; not a recovered flow-normal transect.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Surface geostrophic climatological MDT contour support; no fixed-depth width slab. Hydrographic and bottom-referenced transport layers are separate.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"CNES-CLS18 MDT reference period 1993-2012. Assimilated observations 1993-2016, Argo validation 2001-2017, and cruises February 2016/December 2017 are separate supports; no dated width occupation or monthly widths.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Source-defined NB to SB meridional separation at 144 degrees W, MDT contours [0.3, -1.11] m; no adopted velocity cutoff.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://repository.kopri.re.kr/bitstream/201206/10947/1/2019-0214.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Park, Y.-H. et al. (2019), Observations of the Antarctic Circumpolar Current Over the Udintsev Fracture Zone, the Narrowest Choke Point in the Southern Ocean, JGR Oceans 124, 4511-4528, doi:10.1029/2019JC015024.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"PDF p7 / printed 4517; definitions pp3,5-6 / printed 4513,4515-4516; Figure 5 p8 / printed 4518.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-09\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"original_article_climatological_mdt_contour_description\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate quantity transcribed from original p4517; selected methods and Figure 5 visually reviewed. No contour-coordinate extraction or recomputation.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Boundary-defined breadth · Udintsev\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Original regional MDT method reviewed. Two different contour-defined quantities remain distinct; exact paired coordinates and numerical uncertainty unresolved.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Recover exact matched contour coordinates and reproduce the meridional separation with product provenance.\",\r\n        \"Establish dated contour/velocity definitions before monthly or seasonal widths.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission; no whole-current ranking, route buffer or physical state intersection.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"width_passage_visually_inspected\": true,\r\n        \"description_kind\": \"climatological-mdt-boundary-breadth\",\r\n        \"underlying_width_methods_reviewed\": true,\r\n        \"full_study_reproduced\": false,\r\n        \"temporal_operator\": \"climatological_mean\",\r\n        \"product\": \"CNES-CLS18 MDT\",\r\n        \"reference_period_years\": [\r\n          1993,\r\n          2012\r\n        ],\r\n        \"boundary_labels\": [\r\n          \"NB\",\r\n          \"SB\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"boundary_mdt_m\": [\r\n          0.3,\r\n          -1.11\r\n        ],\r\n        \"intermediate_front\": null,\r\n        \"boundary_coordinates_ex