00 km interval. Numerical uncertainty unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"CNES-CLS18 MDT reference period 1993–2012; boundary contours [0.3, -1.11] m. Figure 5 uses meridional separation; exact paired geographic coordinates not extracted. Cruise months, Argo validation, grid spacing and transport do not define width dates, depth or uncertainty. No seasonal width playback.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/acc-park-2019-udintsev-breadths-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"311b5a41781c9987c81dc0b6c720f7a2cc3ebe2451cfcd696a19300b3fecc8a2\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/1\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"monsoon-webber-2018-observed-near-surface-flow-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"monsoon\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Monsoon Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 300,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"approximate_regional_point_no_reported_interval\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate author description for this feature definition. Not a range endpoint, annual extrema or confidence interval.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Northward Southwest Monsoon Current around 8 N in the southern Bay of Bengal during July 2016. Existing eastward Sri Lanka route is a different regional reach.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Study analyzes east–west sections at 8 N across northward flow; exact paired width endpoints not extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Near-surface northward flow; no fixed numerical depth slice or depth interval supplied for the width.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"July 2016 campaign description; width observation days and repeated width measurements not extracted.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"A