 or an occupied current footprint. Numerical uncertainty and paired edges unresolved.\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"Approximately 300 km · July 2016 surface-flow breadth. Observed northward near-surface flow includes recirculation. Separate feature definitions; no 150–300 km range. Numerical uncertainty unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Author-reported approximate surface breadth in the July 2016 observational/model study. No paired edge coordinates or numerical velocity cutoff extracted. July 2016 study context; no extracted monthly width series. Earlier 100–200 km scaling assumptions, ±4 Sv transport uncertainty and the 110 m NEMO display depth do not establish width support or error.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/monsoon-webber-2018-distinct-widths-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"01add615729f0ebf28ac9632cf4f76b85d9a0d2e67af33cee9088e52018192c4\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/0\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"monsoon-webber-2018-conditional-salinity-origin-component-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"monsoon\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Monsoon Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_inferred_origin_proxy_component_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 150,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"approximate_regional_point_no_reported_interval\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate author description for this feature definition. Not a range endpoint, annual extrema or confidence interval.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Northward Southwest Monsoon Current around 8 N in the southern Bay of Bengal during July 2016. Existing eastward Sri Lanka route is a different regional reach.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Study analyzes east–west sections at 8 N across northward flow; exact paired width endpoints not extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Subsurface salinity-maximum origin proxy; no fixed measurement depth interval supplied. Figure 4 model display at 110 m is separate.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"July 2016 campaign description; width observation days and repeated width measurements not extracted.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Conditional author interpretation: assume subsurface salinity maximum identifies Arabian Sea origin. No clear boundary separates continuous and recirculating flow; some origin-proxy water still recirculates.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1175/JPO-D-17-0215.1\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Webber, Matthews, Vinayachandran, Neema, Sanchez-Franks, Vijith, Amol and Baranowski (2018), The Dynamics of the Southwest Monsoon Current in 2016 from High-Resolution In Situ Observations and Models, JPO 48, 2259–2282, doi:10.1175/JPO-D-17-0215.1.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Original PDF p9 / printed p2267, section 3c, continuation from p8.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-09\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_original_campaign_regional_description\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate numerical description transcribed from visually inspected original prose, retaining its conditionality and feature definition. No width boundary digitization.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Conditional Arabian Sea origin component\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Original pape