tainty_sv\": 4,\r\n          \"nemo_figure4_display_depth_m\": 110,\r\n          \"prior_study_widths_independently_reviewed\": false\r\n        },\r\n        \"display_title\": \"Conditional Arabian Sea origin component\",\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Monsoon Current: approximately 150 kilometres, Conditional Arabian Sea origin component. July 2016 southern Bay of Bengal study. Distinct from the other component, not a pooled width range, annual extrema or an occupied current footprint. Numerical uncertainty and paired edges unresolved.\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"Approximately 150 km · Conditional Arabian Sea origin component. Conditional salinity-maximum origin proxy; some water still recirculates. Separate feature definitions; no 150–300 km range. Numerical uncertainty unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Conditional author interpretation: assume subsurface salinity maximum identifies Arabian Sea origin. No clear boundary separates continuous and recirculating flow; some origin-proxy water still recirculates. July 2016 study context; no extracted monthly width series. Earlier 100–200 km scaling assumptions, ±4 Sv transport uncertainty and the 110 m NEMO display depth do not establish width support or error.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/monsoon-webber-2018-distinct-widths-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"01add615729f0ebf28ac9632cf4f76b85d9a0d2e67af33cee9088e52018192c4\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/1\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"tasman-front-nilsson-1980-meander-occupied-band\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"tasman-front\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Tasman Front\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_meander_occupied_band_breadth\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 600,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"approximate_regional_point_no_reported_interval\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One approximate author description for this feature definition. Not a range endpoint, annual extrema or confidence interval.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Zonal band in the Tasman Sea containing a meandering front extending from Australia to New Zealand; band center described as near 33 or 34 S.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Meridional breadth of a zonal occupied band; no exact paired cross-band edges extracted.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Regional dynamic-height and thermal-structure synthesis; no fixed numerical layer assigned to the band breadth.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Historical report synthesis using surveys and earlier sections; not a dated repeated-width series or annual climatology.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported approximate breadth of the band occupied by a meandering front and associated eddies; not boundaries of one jet.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://ntrs.nasa.gov/api/citations/19800022345/downloads/19800022345.pdf\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Nilsson, Andrews, Lawrence, Ball and Latham (1980), Heat Capacity Mapping Mission Project HCM-051: Progress Report to 30 April 1980, RAN Research Laboratory Internal Technical Memorandum 3/80; NASA NTRS 19800022345.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Original PDF p27 / printed p23, section 3.9; p26 / printed p22 provides separate maximum-scale context.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-09\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"original_technical_report_regional_synthesis\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Factual numerical prose extraction from visually inspected original report; no map or boundary digitization.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playba